{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"130634785b4c5c1f553c4aba4753d2f42b16379f5d7257a3a24b394fd2da7303","ja":"（昨日も●●●●プロデューサーさんとのゲーム、\n楽しかったな～）","zh":"（昨天和●●●●制作人一起玩游戏，\n也很开心呢～）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d30794acdab3d8c1e5ee183ccaf7e515370b0e1890a8bd70bbd060ee2f39e829","ja":"（……あれ？　でも、なんだかイメージしてたのと\n違う気が……。どうしてなんだろう…………あっ！）","zh":"（……咦？不过，总觉得和想象中的\n不太一样……。为什么会这样呢…………啊！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"094942d6a1e33c8f86126a12e305659a9e79258b4b86ebc2e29218dad5662b56","ja":"あ、百合子さん、●●●●プロデューサーさん\nとのゲーム、楽しんでいますか～？","zh":"啊，百合子，和●●●●制作人的\n游戏，玩得开心吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fafb9ca58d369097f1d4fad0442f6176baa8d515b057daf7c6da1b6737a06b16","ja":"はい、楽しんではいるんですけど……。\nちょっと思ってたのと違ってるというか……。","zh":"挺开心的，不过……\n感觉和想的有点不太一样……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8dd7e2e933d173025608ebd310584a8386604fa9b4247c1a7350b4b599a3ec55","ja":"おや～、気になる言い方ですね～？","zh":"哎呀～，这说法很让人在意呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0d75a69c41c98f91bbb922ec69cd84b8903e6abd5ee02c44e3b8b743bc140aa3","ja":"その、運動部みたいになっちゃってるように\n感じてしまって……。","zh":"那个，总觉得变得像\n运动社团一样了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7a426388ea919c7211e49480c92063a13c89592b60963a158c63a01f20cc9c00","ja":"運動部……ですか～？\n体を動かすゲームではなかったですよね～？","zh":"运动部……吗～？\n应该不是活动身体的游戏吧～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"68443fa4b2648c6c8d4437d0b644db6964a830849c3b0c2794c13ba726089e4c","ja":"そうなんですけど、どうすれば上達するかな？　とか\n次は何を覚えてもらおうかな？　とか考えてたら……。","zh":"虽然是这样，可是一想到怎样才能进步呢？\n或是接下来该让他们学些什么呢？结果就……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"fca57b81495f649bbcdf38615e8bf69d3a347dbd5c59b45f1f5ef42a5e261c6d","ja":"なんだか、運動部の先輩になった気分に\nなってきちゃったんです！","zh":"总觉得，自己好像变得越来越有\n运动社团前辈的那种感觉了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"68bc8e8275dd3207ce3bc4f8579aea06559efac96ed666ca2b1371517f293097","ja":"なるほど……。","zh":"原来如此……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"98816f6eb4af5e039462085b9e60d43b8a661f72e85da8bb5f57bbaec7753358","ja":"つまりゲームの世界では、百合子さんが導き、\n見守る側の存在になったのですね～。","zh":"也就是说在游戏世界里，百合子成了引导并\n守护他人的一方呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"121817533b36b5b16f084fc90aaf445cbda5e8abdc0fc67fc138adaf26729518","ja":"導き、見守る側……。●●●●プロデューサーさんが\nいつも私たちにしてくれていること……。","zh":"指引、守护的一方……。制作人先生\n一直以来为我们做的事……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"af399dbb974482e4643080d9654a120799d332d5201bfbb916ada3d451bb6a32","ja":"そっか、これが\n●●●●プロデューサーさんの気持ちなんだ……。","zh":"原来，这就是\n●●●●制作人的心情啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1016.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"84664a2b8e31616c1547965c569ad38cdc488d458f4cfa1992603673754fe69a","ja":"ふふ、なんだか、●●●●プロデューサーさんのこと\nもっと知ることができたみたいで、嬉しいです♪","zh":"呵呵，总觉得能对●●●●制作人\n有了更多了解，好开心呀♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
